# Scratch queue rows MELT (plan_process_overhaul.md P2.1). Data: the queue table in scratch_queue.md is generated
# from this file (python3 tools/status_index.py). Format: tools/scratch_query/qrows.py docstring.
# Run: qrun.py run OUT feature_writeup/testing/rows/MELT.qb RES [--section KEY] [--rows ID,...]

@@section 1
@@title SQ-MELT Melting system: salt, fire and lava melt ice and snow, 2026-11-14 ([melting.md](../melting.md) 7, [plan_bugfix_1114.md](../plan_bugfix_1114.md) 3.8, 5.1, 7.1; TODO `creativedelight/members #56`)
@@date 2026-11-14
@@jars creativebrewing creativecommon creativecompat creativedelight powergrid
@@sources feature_writeup/melting.md feature_writeup/plan_bugfix_1114.md
@@text
@@text Creative Common 1.2.0 of 2026-11-14 (installed), with Creative Delight rebuilt so its salt member no longer melts by
@@text block tick. Group A superflat unless noted; `gamerule randomTickSpeed 1000` for every melt row (`-04` counts steps, so
@@text note the speed), back to 3 for SQ-MELT-P1. Each case gets its own spot at least 12 blocks from the others; probe the
@@text end state with `execute if block`. Config keys are in `config/creativecompat-common.toml` `[melting]` (added by Forge
@@text on the first boot; `grep` before a `qrun.py toml` edit).
@@text
@@table
## SQ-MELT-01 | salt melts touching ice to a water source, snow block / powder snow / layer to air; salt stays
@group A
@commands `setblock X -60 Z salt:salt_block`; around it (touching): `minecraft:ice`, `minecraft:snow_block`, `minecraft:powder_snow`, `minecraft:snow[layers=3]` (layer on a stone block beside the salt); wait 120 s at randomTickSpeed 1000
@pass ice -> `minecraft:water[level=0]`, the other three -> air; the Salt Block stays; latest.log `[melting] tags:` line with salt >= 2
@fails `#creativecompat:melting/salt` empty (`melting_tags.js`, `has('salt')`); snow block and powder snow not melting: `[melting] random ticks on for N extra blocks` missing or N < 4 (`extraRandomTickBlocks`)
@from batches/r1115/p3_a1.qb
# self-contained since r1118 R2 (2026-11-18): setup and build from r1115 p3_a1.qb P3-00 / P3-01 (not migrated);
# bot m3 keeps the area random-ticking (no player near = no random ticks); the retired zmelt probe is not used
> forceload add 1984 1984 2143 2143
> gamerule doFireTick false
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> time set 18000
> weather clear 1000000
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
sleep 3
> execute unless entity m3 run pbot spawn m3 2060 -60 2060 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> setblock 2001 -61 2000 minecraft:ice
> setblock 1999 -61 2000 minecraft:snow_block
> setblock 2000 -61 2001 minecraft:powder_snow
> setblock 2000 -61 1999 minecraft:snow[layers=3]
> setblock 2000 -61 2000 salt:salt_block
sleep 1
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|Block property)
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 1000
sleep 120
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute if block 2001 -61 2000 minecraft:water[level=0] run say SQ-MELT-01-ice_water
> execute if block 1999 -61 2000 minecraft:air run say SQ-MELT-01-snowblock_air
> execute if block 2000 -61 2001 minecraft:air run say SQ-MELT-01-powder_air
> execute if block 2000 -61 1999 minecraft:air run say SQ-MELT-01-layer_air
> execute if block 2000 -61 2000 salt:salt_block run say SQ-MELT-01-salt_kept
expect SQ-MELT-01-ice_water$
expect SQ-MELT-01-snowblock_air$
expect SQ-MELT-01-powder_air$
expect SQ-MELT-01-layer_air$
expect SQ-MELT-01-salt_kept$
bootexpect \[melting\] tags: \d+ meltable, \d+ slow, ([2-9]|\d\d+) salt
look [melting] tags salt >= 2 (bootexpect above); the five end states above

## SQ-MELT-02 | fire, soul fire, lit campfire, lit soul campfire, magma: ice and snow at 3 melt, at 4 not; unlit campfire nothing
@group A
@commands In a lit room (one torch-free row): ice at distance 3 from `minecraft:fire` (on netherrack) and at distance 4 from a second fire; the same pair for `soul_fire` (on soul soil), `campfire[lit=true]`, `soul_campfire[lit=true]`, `magma_block`; plus ice 1 from `campfire[lit=false]`; wait 120 s at randomTickSpeed 1000
@pass every distance-3 ice melted, every distance-4 ice still ice (each pair); the unlit-campfire ice still ice
@fails the 4-block ice melted: range wrong or vanilla light melt on (`vanillaLightMelting`); magma at 3 not melting: SQ-MELT-07; unlit campfire melting: `fireActive` (lit property)
@from batches/r1115/p3_a1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-23
# self-contained since r1118 R2 (2026-11-18): setup and build from r1115 p3_a1.qb P3-00 / P3-01 (not migrated);
