## SQ-MELT-03 | lava source, flowing lava, lava cauldron melt ice at 4; source at 5 not
@group A
@commands Ice at distance 4 and at distance 5 from a lava source; ice at 4 from flowing lava (`setblock ... minecraft:lava[level=3]`, blocked from spreading by a glass ring); a `lava_cauldron` with ice at 4; wait 120 s at randomTickSpeed 1000
@pass distance 4 melted (source, flowing, cauldron); distance 5 still ice
@fails flowing lava missed: the fluid check (`FluidTags.LAVA`); cauldron missed: `#creativecompat:melting/lava`
@from batches/r1115/p3_a1.qb
# self-contained since r1118 R2 (2026-11-18): setup and build from r1115 p3_a1.qb P3-00 / P3-01 (not migrated);
