## SQ-MELT-04 | blue ice beside salt never steps (salt skips blue ice, melting.md 1); packed ice: fire never, lava within 2 (randomTickSpeed 100, 5 min)
@group A
@commands Four Salt Blocks each touching one `minecraft:blue_ice`; the first watched every tick for 5 min (`cdevtest watch`); packed ice touching fire and packed ice at distance 2 from fire; packed ice at 2 and at 3 from lava; wait 5 min
@pass blue ice beside salt stays blue ice (blue0 watched every tick, no state change; blue1 to blue3 end states blue ice); plain ice beside salt went to water; packed ice touching fire kept (fire never melts the slow tier), at 2 from fire kept; at 2 from lava stepped, at 3 not
@fails skipped tiers: `slowSteps`; no steps at all: blue/packed not random ticking (`extraRandomTickBlocks`)
@from batches/r1115/p3_a1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-23
# self-contained since r1118 R2 (2026-11-18): setup and build from r1115 p3_a1.qb P3-00 / P3-01 (not migrated);
# bot m3 keeps the area random-ticking (no player near = no random ticks); the retired zmelt probe is not used
> forceload add 1984 1984 2143 2143
> gamerule doFireTick false
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> time set 18000
> weather clear 1000000
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
sleep 3
> execute unless entity m3 run pbot spawn m3 2060 -60 2060 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
# blue0 is watched every tick (one watch at a time: watch lines carry no position) and its state sequence must be
# blue -> packed -> ice -> water without a skipped tier; the other cases are judged by their end state
> setblock 2001 -61 2084 minecraft:blue_ice
> setblock 2000 -61 2084 salt:salt_block
> setblock 2007 -61 2084 minecraft:blue_ice
> setblock 2006 -61 2084 salt:salt_block
> setblock 2013 -61 2084 minecraft:blue_ice
> setblock 2012 -61 2084 salt:salt_block
> setblock 2019 -61 2084 minecraft:blue_ice
> setblock 2018 -61 2084 salt:salt_block
> setblock 2025 -61 2084 minecraft:ice
> setblock 2024 -61 2084 salt:salt_block
> setblock 2001 -61 2096 minecraft:packed_ice
> setblock 2000 -62 2096 minecraft:netherrack
> setblock 2000 -61 2096 minecraft:fire
> setblock 2014 -61 2096 minecraft:packed_ice
> setblock 2012 -62 2096 minecraft:netherrack
> setblock 2012 -61 2096 minecraft:fire
> setblock 2026 -61 2096 minecraft:packed_ice
> setblock 2024 -61 2096 minecraft:lava
> setblock 2039 -61 2096 minecraft:packed_ice
> setblock 2036 -61 2096 minecraft:lava
sleep 1
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|Block property)
> cdevtest watch 2001 -61 2084 6000 1
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 100
waitlog verb=watch end=done 400
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
shell awk '/verb=watch watching=state ticks=6000 every=1/{n=1; k=0; last=""} n && /verb=watch t=[0-9]+ state=/{match($0,/state="?[a-z0-9_:]+/); v=substr($0,RSTART,RLENGTH); sub(/state="?/,"",v); if(v!=last){q[++k]=v; last=v}} END{s=""; for(i=1;i<=k;i++) s=s" "q[i]; print "MELT-04 blue0 sequence:" s; exit !(k>0 && s ~ /^ minecraft:blue_ice( minecraft:packed_ice( minecraft:ice( minecraft:water)?)?)?$/)}' logs/latest.log
> cdevtest state 2007 -61 2084
> cdevtest state 2013 -61 2084
