## SQ-MELT-21 | carry-over, merge: old Common [melting] copied into an existing Compat toml without [melting]
@group A (full pack, fixture tomls)
@commands before boot put `old_creativecommon-common.toml` (saltRange 2, endNoFire false) as `config/creativecommon-common.toml` and `compat_without_melting.toml` as `config/creativecompat-common.toml`; boot; read both files and the log
@pass `config/creativecompat-common.toml` `[melting]` has saltRange = 2 and endNoFire = false; `config/creativecommon-common.toml` has no `[melting]` after the boot; latest.log has `[swaps] config sections [melting] merged`; no WARN naming `[melting]`; no `Missing`, `missing registry` or `unknown` line naming `creativecommon:glass_shards` or `creativecommon:melting`
@fails `MovedKeys.mergeSections` in Compat (runs before the config registers); Common still declaring `[melting]` (should have dropped it); a loot modifier id left in a saved list
@modset none
@reviewed 2026-11-25
# r1124gate (2026-11-24, runner-4): self-contained; the pack copies are kept as *.melt21bak and put back at the end
# (Common's config watcher reloads them on the running server). Fixtures: tools/scratch_query/fixtures/wave2_carry/.
edit cp config/creativecommon-common.toml config/creativecommon-common.toml.melt21bak; cp config/creativecompat-common.toml config/creativecompat-common.toml.melt21bak; cp "$INST/tools/scratch_query/fixtures/wave2_carry/old_creativecommon-common.toml" config/creativecommon-common.toml && cp "$INST/tools/scratch_query/fixtures/wave2_carry/compat_without_melting.toml" config/creativecompat-common.toml && ! grep -qE "^[[:space:]]*\[melting" config/creativecompat-common.toml
restart
bootexpect \[swaps\] config sections \[melting\] merged from creativecommon-common\.toml into creativecompat-common\.toml
bootreject \[swaps\] config sections \[melting\] carried over
bootreject still has sections that moved|could not (merge|carry) config sections
bootreject WARN\].*\[melting\]
bootreject ^(?=.*([Mm]issing|[Uu]nknown)).*creativecommon:(glass_shards|melting)
shell awk '/^[[:space:]]*\[/{s=$0} s ~ /^[[:space:]]*\[melting\][[:space:]]*$/' config/creativecompat-common.toml | grep -E "^[[:space:]]*(saltRange|fireRange|meltChance|endNoFire|enabled) ="
shell awk '/^[[:space:]]*\[/{s=$0} s ~ /^[[:space:]]*\[melting\][[:space:]]*$/' config/creativecompat-common.toml | grep -qE "^[[:space:]]*saltRange = 2[[:space:]]*$"
shell awk '/^[[:space:]]*\[/{s=$0} s ~ /^[[:space:]]*\[melting\][[:space:]]*$/' config/creativecompat-common.toml | grep -qE "^[[:space:]]*endNoFire = false[[:space:]]*$"
shell ! grep -nE "^[[:space:]]*\[melting" config/creativecommon-common.toml
shell cp config/creativecompat-common.toml config/creativecompat-common.toml.melt21 && cp config/creativecommon-common.toml config/creativecommon-common.toml.melt21 && cp config/creativecommon-common.toml.melt21bak config/creativecommon-common.toml && cp config/creativecompat-common.toml.melt21bak config/creativecompat-common.toml
look merged line names [melting]; the Compat [melting] keys printed show saltRange = 2, endNoFire = false (the carried files are kept as *.melt21)
